abstract: >-
  A Python package for automated detection and analysis of slip-stick phenomena
  in tensile test data from FTM 10 testing machines. The software implements
  instrumental noise characterization, zero-phase Butterworth filtering, and
  Savitzky-Golay baseline correction to identify force residual spikes that
  indicate slip-stick events. Designed for publication-quality data processing
  with reproducible analysis pipelines and comprehensive visualization capabilities.
keywords:
  - slip-stick
  - tensile testing
  - signal processing
  - materials science
  - friction
  - adhesion
  - FTM 10
  - Python
